1
00:00:01,047 --> 00:00:03,757
Cardinal: UNDER THE ALL-POWERFUL
ADMINISTRATOR’S RULE,

2
00:00:03,757 --> 00:00:06,767
THIS WORLD ENTERED
A LONG PERIOD OF PEACE,

3
00:00:06,767 --> 00:00:08,137
AND THE PEOPLE BECAME APATHETIC.

4
00:00:10,307 --> 00:00:13,897
70 YEARS HAD PASSED SINCE
QUINELLA BECAME ADMINISTRATOR.

5
00:00:15,357 --> 00:00:17,317
THEN, ONE DAY,

6
00:00:17,317 --> 00:00:19,777
SHE REALIZED
SHE’D UNDERGONE A CHANGE.

7
00:00:24,527 --> 00:00:25,987
SHE USED HER CONTROL COMMAND

8
00:00:25,987 --> 00:00:28,707
TO EXAMINE HER FLUCTLIGHT
AND DISCOVERED

9
00:00:28,707 --> 00:00:31,627
IT HAD REACHED ITS CAPACITY
TO RETAIN HER MEMORIES.

10
00:00:34,127 --> 00:00:36,337
SHE REFUSED TO ACCEPT IT,

11
00:00:36,337 --> 00:00:39,717
SO SHE CAME UP WITH
ANOTHER MONSTROUS SOLUTION.

12
00:00:39,717 --> 00:00:41,507
Administrator: WELCOME, CHILD.

13
00:00:43,257 --> 00:00:45,217
PLEASE, COME CLOSER.

14
00:00:45,217 --> 00:00:47,097
Girl: YES, MA’AM.

15
00:00:47,097 --> 00:00:49,847
Administrator: IF I CAN
OVERWRITE HER FLUCTLIGHT

16
00:00:49,847 --> 00:00:53,267
WITH A COPY OF THE THOUGHTS
AND MEMORIES FROM MY OWN,

17
00:00:53,267 --> 00:00:55,317
I WILL NEVER LOSE THEM.

18
00:00:55,317 --> 00:00:56,567
CLOSE YOUR EYES.

19
00:00:57,777 --> 00:00:59,947
( girl whimpers )

20
00:00:59,947 --> 00:01:02,907
Cardinal: IT WAS
A DIABOLICAL CEREMONY...

21
00:01:04,827 --> 00:01:06,987
A FUSING OF SOUL AND MEMORY

22
00:01:06,987 --> 00:01:09,707
WHICH SHE CALLED
THE SYNTHESIS RITUAL.

23
00:01:09,707 --> 00:01:14,457
WITH IT, SHE COULD SEIZE CONTROL
OF ANOTHER HUMAN’S FLUCTLIGHT.

24
00:01:14,457 --> 00:01:17,627
AND HERE WAS
WHERE ADMINISTRATOR,

25
00:01:17,627 --> 00:01:21,167
OR QUINELLA,
MADE A CRITICAL MISTAKE.

26
00:01:21,167 --> 00:01:22,837
Kirito: WHAT DO YOU MEAN?

27
00:01:22,837 --> 00:01:25,597
Cardinal: IT DIDN’T OCCUR TO HER
THAT, DURING THE PROCESS

28
00:01:25,597 --> 00:01:28,637
OF TAKING OVER THE YOUNG GIRL
AND DELETING HER OLD SELF,

29
00:01:28,637 --> 00:01:30,427
THERE WOULD BE A SPLIT SECOND

30
00:01:30,427 --> 00:01:34,147
WHERE TWO GODS WITH EQUAL POWER
EXISTED AT THE SAME TIME.

31
00:01:34,147 --> 00:01:36,727
KIRITO, YOU ARE FAMILIAR

32
00:01:36,727 --> 00:01:38,857
WITH MY ORIGINAL VERSION,
ARE YOU NOT?

33
00:01:38,857 --> 00:01:42,277
WHAT IS THE MAIN FEATURE
OF THE CARDINAL SYSTEM?

34
00:01:42,277 --> 00:01:44,357
Kirito: OH, UM...

35
00:01:44,357 --> 00:01:46,447
IT’S SUPPOSED
TO OPERATE AUTOMATICALLY

36
00:01:46,447 --> 00:01:48,117
FOR LONG PERIODS OF TIME.

37
00:01:48,117 --> 00:01:49,747
IT DOESN’T NEED HUMANS TO RUN.

38
00:01:49,747 --> 00:01:52,537
Cardinal: THAT IS CORRECT,
AND, TO FACILITATE IT,

39
00:01:52,537 --> 00:01:54,787
THE CARDINAL SYSTEM
HAS TWO CORE PROGRAMS,

40
00:01:54,787 --> 00:01:57,627
A MAIN PROCESS AND A SUBPROCESS.

41
00:01:57,627 --> 00:02:00,917
THE MAIN PROCESS PERFORMS
BALANCE CONTROLS ON THE SYSTEM.

42
00:02:00,917 --> 00:02:04,507
Kirito: WHILE THE SUBPROCESS
RUNS ERROR CHECKS ON THE MAIN.

43
00:02:04,507 --> 00:02:06,387
Cardinal: PRECISELY.

44
00:02:06,387 --> 00:02:09,677
WHEN SHE BECAME ADMINISTRATOR,
THE PRESERVATION OF ORDER

45
00:02:09,677 --> 00:02:12,927
WASN’T THE ONLY THING QUINELLA
ETCHED ONTO HER FLUCTLIGHT.

46
00:02:12,927 --> 00:02:15,727
IN THE RECESSES OF HER SOUL,

47
00:02:15,727 --> 00:02:19,567
I STILL FUNCTIONED
AS THE SUBPROCESS TO HER MAIN,

48
00:02:19,567 --> 00:02:22,277
AND I WAS OBLIGATED
TO CORRECT HER ERRORS.

49
00:02:22,277 --> 00:02:23,737
( Kirito gasps )

50
00:02:25,157 --> 00:02:27,237
Cardinal: FOR 70 LONG YEARS,

51
00:02:27,237 --> 00:02:29,327
I WAITED FOR MY OPPORTUNITY...

52
00:02:30,827 --> 00:02:33,787
AND FINALLY IT HAD ARRIVED!

53
00:02:33,787 --> 00:02:35,247
♪

54
00:02:35,247 --> 00:02:37,787
♪ SHINY SWORD, MY DIAMOND ♪

55
00:02:37,787 --> 00:02:39,417
( singing in Japanese )

56
00:02:50,557 --> 00:02:51,557
♪ IT’S TIME ♪

57
00:02:51,557 --> 00:02:53,387
( singing in Japanese )

58
00:03:09,657 --> 00:03:11,577
♪

59
00:04:11,787 --> 00:04:13,377
Administrator: IT WORKED.

60
00:04:13,377 --> 00:04:16,377
THIS LITTLE GIRL’S FLUCTLIGHT
IS MINE NOW.

61
00:04:16,377 --> 00:04:18,507
- Cardinal: SYSTEM CALL.
- ( Administrator gasps )

62
00:04:18,507 --> 00:04:21,257
Cardinal:
GENERATE LUMINOUS ELEMENT.

63
00:04:21,257 --> 00:04:24,347
LIGHTNING SHAPE. DISCHARGE!

64
00:04:24,347 --> 00:04:25,387
Administrator: WHAT?

65
00:04:26,807 --> 00:04:28,517
Cardinal: SYSTEM CALL!

66
00:04:30,387 --> 00:04:32,347
GENERATE LUMINOUS ELEMENT!

67
00:04:32,347 --> 00:04:33,727
Administrator: SYSTEM CALL!

68
00:04:33,727 --> 00:04:36,727
GENERATE UMBRA ELEMENT.
BALL SHAPE!

69
00:04:36,727 --> 00:04:38,067
Both: DISCHARGE!

70
00:04:40,737 --> 00:04:43,607
Administrator: SYSTEM CALL!
REDEFINE OBJECT!

71
00:04:45,907 --> 00:04:47,407
SWORD CLASS!

72
00:04:47,407 --> 00:04:49,537
Cardinal: SYSTEM CALL.

73
00:04:49,537 --> 00:04:51,617
REDEFINE OBJECT!

74
00:04:51,617 --> 00:04:53,037
ROD CLASS!

75
00:04:53,037 --> 00:04:54,627
Administrator: SYSTEM CALL!

76
00:04:54,627 --> 00:04:57,417
CHANGE FIELD ATTRIBUTE!

77
00:04:59,337 --> 00:05:00,797
Cardinal: NO!

78
00:05:00,797 --> 00:05:05,387
SHE MADE THIS AREA OFF-LIMITS
FOR SYSTEM COMMANDS.

79
00:05:05,387 --> 00:05:06,927
- ( Administrator grunts )
- ( Cardinal grunts )

80
00:05:19,777 --> 00:05:21,737
I CAN’T DEFEAT HER
IN THIS BODY.

81
00:05:21,737 --> 00:05:24,197
( gasps )

82
00:05:25,317 --> 00:05:26,657
( staff rings clinking )

83
00:05:33,917 --> 00:05:34,997
( Administrator gasps )

84
00:05:34,997 --> 00:05:36,917
Cardinal: SYSTEM CALL!

85
00:05:36,917 --> 00:05:38,877
GENERATE AERIAL ELEMENT!

86
00:05:38,877 --> 00:05:40,457
STREAM SHAPE!

87
00:05:43,627 --> 00:05:46,087
( narrating ) THERE ARE ONLY
TWO LOCATIONS IN THIS WORLD

88
00:05:46,087 --> 00:05:47,847
WHICH ADMINISTRATOR
HAS NO CONTROL OVER.

89
00:05:49,507 --> 00:05:52,557
ONE IS THE OTHER SIDE
OF THE END MOUNTAINS.

90
00:05:52,557 --> 00:05:54,267
THE OTHER IS...

91
00:05:57,307 --> 00:05:59,647
SYSTEM CALL!

92
00:05:59,647 --> 00:06:00,727
GENERATE BLIZZARD GATE.

93
00:06:00,727 --> 00:06:02,067
ZERO ONE!

94
00:06:04,817 --> 00:06:05,857
( narrating )
...THE GREAT LIBRARY!

95
00:06:08,867 --> 00:06:10,617
IN AN INSTANT,

96
00:06:10,617 --> 00:06:14,867
THIS SPACE WAS COMPLETELY
ISOLATED FROM THE OUTSIDE.

97
00:06:14,867 --> 00:06:19,337
FOR THE PAST 200 YEARS,
I’VE BEEN WATCHING AND PLOTTING.

98
00:06:19,337 --> 00:06:21,497
I WAITED FOR THE PERFECT MOMENT

99
00:06:21,497 --> 00:06:24,297
WHEN I COULD CATCH HER
OFF GUARD, THEN AMBUSH HER.

100
00:06:25,417 --> 00:06:27,047
SHE KNEW WHAT I WAS UP TO

101
00:06:27,047 --> 00:06:29,217
AND WAS CONSTANTLY ON GUARD,

102
00:06:29,217 --> 00:06:33,717
SO SHE CREATED POWERFUL AND
LOYAL SERVANTS FOR PROTECTION.

103
00:06:33,717 --> 00:06:36,267
Administrator:
THROUGH THE SYNTHESIS RITUAL,

104
00:06:36,267 --> 00:06:41,897
THIS MAN WILL BE REBORN
AS A WARRIOR DEVOTED ONLY TO ME,

105
00:06:41,897 --> 00:06:44,647
MY INTEGRITY KNIGHT!

106
00:06:44,647 --> 00:06:46,317
( chorus vocalizing )

107
00:06:46,317 --> 00:06:49,157
Cardinal: THE FIRST ONE SHE
TURNED INTO AN INTEGRITY KNIGHT

108
00:06:49,157 --> 00:06:50,737
WAS AN EXCEPTIONAL SWORDSMAN

109
00:06:50,737 --> 00:06:52,867
WHO HATED
THE RULE OF THE CHURCH.

110
00:06:52,867 --> 00:06:54,947
SEEKING REFUGE FROM IT,

111
00:06:54,947 --> 00:06:58,207
HE AND HIS COMPANIONS FOUNDED
A VILLAGE IN THE OUTER REGIONS.

112
00:06:59,537 --> 00:07:01,037
THE NAME OF THIS KNIGHT

113
00:07:01,037 --> 00:07:03,547
WAS BERCOULI SYNTHESIS ONE.

114
00:07:05,717 --> 00:07:09,087
ONE-ON-ONE, ADMINISTRATOR AND I
ARE EQUALLY MATCHED.

115
00:07:09,087 --> 00:07:10,847
AT LEAST, WE WERE.

116
00:07:10,847 --> 00:07:13,347
HER KNIGHTS
ARE FAST AND POWERFUL.

117
00:07:13,347 --> 00:07:16,557
THEY MADE THE PROSPECT
OF AMBUSHING HER IMPOSSIBLE,

118
00:07:16,557 --> 00:07:19,057
SO, AT THE RISK
OF BEING SPOTTED,

119
00:07:19,057 --> 00:07:21,267
I SOUGHT OUT MY OWN ALLIES.

120
00:07:21,267 --> 00:07:24,107
I OPENED DOORWAYS
FAR FROM THE CATHEDRAL,

121
00:07:24,107 --> 00:07:26,027
THEN CAST
SENSORY SHARING SPELLS

122
00:07:26,027 --> 00:07:28,607
UPON BIRDS AND INSECTS
AND SENT THEM OUT

123
00:07:28,607 --> 00:07:31,487
TO LEAD POTENTIAL ALLIES
BACK HERE TO ME.

124
00:07:31,487 --> 00:07:32,487
( chuckles )

125
00:07:32,487 --> 00:07:33,157
Kirito: UH...

126
00:07:34,827 --> 00:07:36,367
HUH? ( gasps )

127
00:07:37,957 --> 00:07:39,207
Cardinal: LOOK HERE.

128
00:07:40,577 --> 00:07:41,827
MEET CHARLOTTE.

129
00:07:41,827 --> 00:07:44,047
SHE SPOTTED
YOU AND EUGEO IN RULID

130
00:07:44,047 --> 00:07:46,007
AND HAS BEEN
TAGGING ALONG WITH YOU

131
00:07:46,007 --> 00:07:47,587
EVER SINCE YOU LEFT THAT PLACE.

132
00:07:47,587 --> 00:07:51,467
SOMETIMES SHE DID MORE
THAN JUST TAG ALONG.

133
00:07:51,467 --> 00:07:52,467
( Kirito gasps )

134
00:07:52,467 --> 00:07:54,757
SHE WAS THE ONE GUIDING ME

135
00:07:54,757 --> 00:07:56,557
WHEN WE WERE RUNNING
FROM THAT KNIGHT.

136
00:07:56,557 --> 00:07:59,017
HUH! SNEAKY.

137
00:07:59,017 --> 00:08:01,687
SO BACK WHEN MY ZEPHILIAS
GOT CHOPPED UP,

138
00:08:01,687 --> 00:08:03,647
WAS THAT YOU
GIVING ME THE PEP TALK?

139
00:08:04,727 --> 00:08:05,977
UH...

140
00:08:05,977 --> 00:08:07,647
Cardinal: SHE’S A SHY ONE.

141
00:08:07,647 --> 00:08:09,897
OF ALL MY OBSERVATION UNITS,

142
00:08:09,897 --> 00:08:13,067
CHARLOTTE HAS BEEN OUT SEARCHING
LONGER THAN THE OTHERS.

143
00:08:13,067 --> 00:08:14,947
AT LAST, SHE CAN REST NOW.

144
00:08:14,947 --> 00:08:16,827
HER MISSION’S COME TO AN END.

145
00:08:16,827 --> 00:08:18,867
WHEN I ENLISTED HER,

146
00:08:18,867 --> 00:08:21,867
I FROZE THE NATURAL DEGRADATION
OF HER LIFE.

147
00:08:21,867 --> 00:08:23,997
THAT WAS OVER 200 YEARS AGO.

148
00:08:23,997 --> 00:08:26,377
( Kirito sighs )
THANKS, CHARLOTTE.

149
00:08:27,587 --> 00:08:29,757
SO, FOR 200 YEARS,

150
00:08:29,757 --> 00:08:32,927
YOU HAD CRITTERS LIKE HER OUT
IN THE WORLD LOOKING FOR HELP,

151
00:08:32,927 --> 00:08:35,847
AND YOU’VE BEEN STUCK
IN HERE THE WHOLE TIME?

152
00:08:35,847 --> 00:08:38,267
Cardinal: INDEED,
AND, AS I SAT HERE

153
00:08:38,267 --> 00:08:40,057
OBSERVING THE WORLD
THROUGH THEIR EYES,

154
00:08:40,057 --> 00:08:41,517
A QUESTION KEPT REPEATING.

155
00:08:43,147 --> 00:08:45,017
WHY WOULD THE GODS
OF THE OUTSIDE

156
00:08:45,017 --> 00:08:46,897
ABANDON A WORLD THEY CREATED

157
00:08:46,897 --> 00:08:51,197
TO SUFFER UNDER THE TYRANNY
OF ADMINISTRATOR, A FALSE GOD?

158
00:08:51,197 --> 00:08:54,907
AS I PONDERED THIS AND REFERRED
TO THE CARDINAL SYSTEM’S

159
00:08:54,907 --> 00:08:57,157
BUILT-IN DATABASE OVER AND OVER,

160
00:08:57,157 --> 00:09:00,117
I EVENTUALLY ARRIVED
AT A CONCLUSION.

161
00:09:00,117 --> 00:09:02,867
RATH MAY BE THE GOD HERE,

162
00:09:02,867 --> 00:09:06,037
BUT IT DOESN’T WANT THE PEOPLE
TO LEAD HAPPY LIVES AT ALL.

163
00:09:06,037 --> 00:09:08,747
IT WANTS THE OPPOSITE.

164
00:09:08,747 --> 00:09:09,707
THIS IS A TEST.

165
00:09:11,717 --> 00:09:13,757
RATH CREATED THE UNDERWORLD

166
00:09:13,757 --> 00:09:16,217
SO THEY CAN OBSERVE
HOW ITS PEOPLE REACT

167
00:09:16,217 --> 00:09:18,677
TO STRESS PARAMETERS
PUT UPON THEM.

168
00:09:18,677 --> 00:09:21,807
DAY BY DAY, THEY INCREASE.

169
00:09:21,807 --> 00:09:24,727
EVENTUALLY ALL THOSE STRESSORS
WILL REACH THEIR LIMIT,

170
00:09:24,727 --> 00:09:27,227
AND THE FINAL PHASE OF THE TEST
WILL BE AT HAND.

171
00:09:27,227 --> 00:09:28,767
Kirito: THEN WHAT HAPPENS?

172
00:09:28,767 --> 00:09:31,237
Cardinal: WHAT THESE PEOPLE
FEAR THE MOST,

173
00:09:31,237 --> 00:09:32,857
AN INVASION
FROM OUTSIDE THIS REALM.

174
00:09:34,197 --> 00:09:35,817
Kirito: THE DARK TERRITORY.

175
00:09:35,817 --> 00:09:39,827
Cardinal: CORRECT. THE WORLD
OF DARKNESS WAS CREATED

176
00:09:39,827 --> 00:09:44,037
TO SUBJECT THE UNDERWORLDIANS
TO THE ULTIMATE AGONY.

177
00:09:44,037 --> 00:09:47,377
THE MONSTERS THERE HAVE
FLUCTLIGHTS, JUST LIKE HUMANS.

178
00:09:47,377 --> 00:09:49,587
THE DIFFERENCE IS,
THEIR PRIME DIRECTIVE

179
00:09:49,587 --> 00:09:52,967
IS TO PLUNDER AND SLAUGHTER.

180
00:09:52,967 --> 00:09:54,377
THEY’RE EAGER FOR THE DAY

181
00:09:54,377 --> 00:09:56,587
WHEN THEY CAN BREACH
THE LAND OF THE IUMS,

182
00:09:56,587 --> 00:09:59,137
AS THEY CALL YOU,
AND WREAK HAVOC.

183
00:09:59,137 --> 00:10:01,057
THAT DAY IS COMING.

184
00:10:01,057 --> 00:10:05,057
Kirito: AND ADMINISTRATOR,
DOES SHE KNOW THEY’RE COMING?

185
00:10:05,057 --> 00:10:07,647
Cardinal: YES,
BUT SHE UNDERESTIMATES THEM.

186
00:10:07,647 --> 00:10:09,687
SHE THINKS SHE
AND HER INTEGRITY KNIGHTS

187
00:10:09,687 --> 00:10:11,567
ARE STRONG ENOUGH TO REPEL THEM.

188
00:10:11,567 --> 00:10:14,277
SHE EVEN HAD
ALL FOUR GUARDIAN DRAGONS SLAIN,

189
00:10:14,277 --> 00:10:16,857
NORTH, SOUTH, EAST, AND WEST.

190
00:10:16,857 --> 00:10:19,367
AS ALLIES,
THEY WOULD HAVE BEEN VALUABLE,

191
00:10:19,367 --> 00:10:21,787
BUT SHE COULD NOT CONTROL THEM.

192
00:10:21,787 --> 00:10:23,827
PITY, SHE CANNOT WIN NOW,

193
00:10:23,827 --> 00:10:26,367
FOR THE FORCES OF DARKNESS
ARE TOO MANY,

194
00:10:26,367 --> 00:10:28,287
AND HER NUMBERS ARE TOO FEW.

195
00:10:28,287 --> 00:10:30,797
Kirito: HANG ON. IF THAT’S TRUE,

196
00:10:30,797 --> 00:10:32,917
THEN WHY BOTHER TAKIN’ HER DOWN?

197
00:10:32,917 --> 00:10:35,087
’CAUSE IT SOUNDS LIKE
THE FATE OF THIS WORLD’S SEALED

198
00:10:35,087 --> 00:10:36,127
WHETHER YOU DO OR DON’T.

199
00:10:36,127 --> 00:10:38,217
Cardinal: YOU ARE CORRECT.

200
00:10:38,217 --> 00:10:39,297
( Kirito gasps )

201
00:10:39,297 --> 00:10:40,927
Cardinal: NO MATTER WHAT I DO,

202
00:10:40,927 --> 00:10:43,887
THE DARK TERRITORY
WILL INVADE THE HUMAN REALM,

203
00:10:43,887 --> 00:10:45,807
AND THERE IS NO STOPPING IT.

204
00:10:45,807 --> 00:10:48,897
Kirito: SO, LIKE,
ONCE YOU STOP ADMINISTRATOR,

205
00:10:48,897 --> 00:10:50,477
YOUR JOB HERE’S DONE,

206
00:10:50,477 --> 00:10:52,187
AND WHATEVER ELSE HAPPENS
HAPPENS.

207
00:10:52,187 --> 00:10:54,737
YOU DON’T CARE, DO YOU?

208
00:10:56,947 --> 00:10:58,197
Cardinal: PERHAPS I DON’T.

209
00:11:00,317 --> 00:11:02,077
HOWEVER...

210
00:11:02,077 --> 00:11:06,367
RATH ENGINEERED
THE BLOODSHED THAT IS TO COME.

211
00:11:06,367 --> 00:11:08,537
I CANNOT ACCEPT
A GOD WHO DOES THAT.

212
00:11:08,537 --> 00:11:13,707
ONCE I LEARNED THE STRESS TEST
WAS UNAVOIDABLE, I DECIDED.

213
00:11:13,707 --> 00:11:18,877
THE HUMAN REALM
AND THE DARK TERRITORY

214
00:11:18,877 --> 00:11:20,967
MUST BE RETURNED TO NOTHINGNESS.

215
00:11:20,967 --> 00:11:23,007
Kirito: HOLD UP. DECIDED?

216
00:11:23,007 --> 00:11:24,307
Cardinal: THAT IS WHAT I SAID.

217
00:11:24,307 --> 00:11:26,517
WHEN I REGAIN CONTROL,

218
00:11:26,517 --> 00:11:30,147
I WILL ACCESS THE FLUCTLIGHTS
STORED IN THE LIGHTCUBE CLUSTER.

219
00:11:30,147 --> 00:11:32,397
THEN I WILL DELETE
EVERY RESIDENT

220
00:11:32,397 --> 00:11:35,027
OF THE REALMS
OF HUMANITY AND DARKNESS.

221
00:11:35,027 --> 00:11:36,987
- ( Kirito shudders )
- Cardinal: THAT SAID,

222
00:11:36,987 --> 00:11:40,817
IF YOU DECIDE TO HELP ME
AND I ELIMINATE ADMINISTRATOR,

223
00:11:40,817 --> 00:11:44,197
I WILL HAVE FULL ACCESS
TO ALL OF MY AUTHORITY.

224
00:11:44,197 --> 00:11:46,287
THEN, BEFORE I
EXTINGUISH THIS WORLD,

225
00:11:46,287 --> 00:11:48,247
I CAN GRANT YOU ONE WISH,

226
00:11:48,247 --> 00:11:50,577
TO A CERTAIN DEGREE, ANYWAY.

227
00:11:50,577 --> 00:11:53,627
IF YOU SINGLE OUT
THOSE YOU WOULD LIKE TO SAVE,

228
00:11:53,627 --> 00:11:56,457
I WILL REFRAIN
FROM DELETING THEIR FLUCTLIGHTS.

229
00:11:56,457 --> 00:11:59,427
- INSTEAD, I WILL ARCHIVE THEM.
- ( Kirito gasps )

230
00:11:59,427 --> 00:12:01,677
Cardinal: AFTER YOU ESCAPE
TO THE REAL WORLD,

231
00:12:01,677 --> 00:12:04,557
YOU CAN SAVE THEIR LIGHTCUBES.

232
00:12:04,557 --> 00:12:07,427
I SHOULD BE ABLE
TO SET ASIDE TEN OR SO.

233
00:12:09,057 --> 00:12:10,057
( Kirito gasps )

234
00:12:10,057 --> 00:12:13,057
I GOTTA PICK?

235
00:12:13,057 --> 00:12:15,477
WAIT A SEC.

236
00:12:15,477 --> 00:12:17,737
SOMETHING DOESN’T ADD UP HERE.

237
00:12:17,737 --> 00:12:20,197
YOU SAID YOUR SOUL’S
A COPY OF HERS.

238
00:12:20,197 --> 00:12:22,357
THAT MEANS
YOU GOT THE SELFISH PART

239
00:12:22,357 --> 00:12:24,657
OF THE NOBILITY IN YOU, TOO,

240
00:12:24,657 --> 00:12:28,617
THE DRIVE TO PUT YOUR WANTS
AND NEEDS ABOVE EVERYONE ELSE’S.

241
00:12:28,617 --> 00:12:33,957
SO WHY’D YOU WAIT HERE ALL
BY YOURSELF AND FOR 200 YEARS?

242
00:12:33,957 --> 00:12:36,747
YOU COULD HAVE FOUND A PLACE
FAR AWAY FROM ADMINISTRATOR

243
00:12:36,747 --> 00:12:38,207
AND HAD SOME KINDA LIFE.

244
00:12:38,207 --> 00:12:39,797
( Cardinal sighs )

245
00:12:39,797 --> 00:12:42,967
THE CARDINAL SUBPROCESS
WAS BURNED INTO ME.

246
00:12:42,967 --> 00:12:46,387
THAT MEANS MY CORE DESIRES
AMOUNT TO ONLY ONE THING,

247
00:12:46,387 --> 00:12:51,017
TO ELIMINATE ADMINISTRATOR AND
RESTORE NORMAL FUNCTION HERE.

248
00:12:51,017 --> 00:12:54,097
TO ME, THERE IS NO WAY TO HAVE
A PROPERLY FUNCTIONING WORLD,

249
00:12:54,097 --> 00:12:56,227
UNLESS THE CORRUPTING ELEMENT
IS DEALT WITH

250
00:12:56,227 --> 00:12:58,397
AND THE SLATE WIPED CLEAN.

251
00:12:58,397 --> 00:13:00,317
ACTUALLY, ON SECOND THOUGHT...

252
00:13:00,317 --> 00:13:02,487
( Kirito sighs )

253
00:13:02,487 --> 00:13:03,907
Cardinal: PERHAPS YOU’RE RIGHT.

254
00:13:03,907 --> 00:13:06,447
I DO HARBOR ONE DESIRE,

255
00:13:06,447 --> 00:13:08,537
SOMETHING I WAS
DESPERATE TO EXPERIENCE

256
00:13:08,537 --> 00:13:11,827
JUST ONCE
FOR THE LAST 200 YEARS.

257
00:13:13,997 --> 00:13:16,087
KIRITO,
WOULD YOU STAND UP, PLEASE?

258
00:13:16,087 --> 00:13:17,037
Kirito: UH...

259
00:13:20,207 --> 00:13:21,917
( Cardinal groans )

260
00:13:21,917 --> 00:13:23,377
Kirito: UH...

261
00:13:27,007 --> 00:13:28,597
Cardinal: THIS SHOULD DO.

262
00:13:28,597 --> 00:13:30,677
ALL RIGHT, PLEASE STEP FORWARD.

263
00:13:33,227 --> 00:13:35,097
- COME CLOSER.
- Kirito: WHY?

264
00:13:35,097 --> 00:13:36,767
Cardinal: DON’T ARGUE WITH ME!

265
00:13:40,067 --> 00:13:41,357
RAISE YOUR ARMS, PLEASE.

266
00:13:41,357 --> 00:13:42,357
Kirito: LIKE THIS?

267
00:13:42,357 --> 00:13:43,777
Cardinal: IN FRONT OF YOU,

268
00:13:43,777 --> 00:13:45,157
AND MAKE A CIRCLE WITH THEM.

269
00:13:45,157 --> 00:13:45,817
Kirito: UH...

270
00:13:47,657 --> 00:13:50,327
Cardinal: HONESTLY,
HOW DENSE ARE YOU?

271
00:13:58,247 --> 00:14:00,457
SO THIS IS IT.

272
00:14:00,457 --> 00:14:03,007
NOW I SEE.

273
00:14:03,007 --> 00:14:05,177
THIS IS
WHAT IT MEANS TO BE HUMAN.

274
00:14:05,177 --> 00:14:06,177
( Kirito grunts )

275
00:14:08,257 --> 00:14:09,717
( Cardinal gasps )

276
00:14:11,427 --> 00:14:12,977
TO BE HELD,

277
00:14:12,977 --> 00:14:16,017
IT’S SO WARM AND COMFORTING.

278
00:14:16,017 --> 00:14:20,227
AFTER 200 YEARS,
THIS MAKES THE WAIT WORTH IT.

279
00:14:20,227 --> 00:14:23,987
TO THINK SOMETHING SO SIMPLE
COULD BE SO SATISFYING.

280
00:14:25,397 --> 00:14:27,317
THE WAIT
WAS MORE THAN WORTH IT.

281
00:14:30,447 --> 00:14:31,947
- ( robe flaps )
- ( Kirito gasps )

282
00:14:37,077 --> 00:14:37,747
Cardinal: HMM?

283
00:14:39,457 --> 00:14:41,247
WELL? HOW LONG ARE YOU PLANNING

284
00:14:41,247 --> 00:14:42,877
TO STAND THERE LIKE THAT?

285
00:14:42,877 --> 00:14:44,837
Kirito: SORRY. JUST BEIN’ HUMAN!

286
00:14:44,837 --> 00:14:47,427
Cardinal: SO THEN,
WHAT’S YOUR DECISION?

287
00:14:47,427 --> 00:14:49,297
Kirito: UH...

288
00:14:49,297 --> 00:14:52,347
Cardinal: WILL YOU HELP ME
STOP ADMINISTRATOR OR NOT?

289
00:14:52,347 --> 00:14:53,887
( Kirito sighs )

290
00:14:53,887 --> 00:14:55,347
YEAH, OKAY.

291
00:14:55,347 --> 00:14:58,187
I’LL HELP YOU WITH THIS PLAN
OF YOURS, SORT OF.

292
00:14:58,187 --> 00:15:00,307
Cardinal: HUH?

293
00:15:00,307 --> 00:15:03,317
Kirito: LOOK, I GET WHERE
YOU’RE COMING FROM AND ALL,

294
00:15:03,317 --> 00:15:05,487
BUT I’M NOT GONNA GIVE UP
ON THIS WORLD,

295
00:15:05,487 --> 00:15:08,607
AND I WON’T GIVE UP
ON ITS PEOPLE.

296
00:15:08,607 --> 00:15:12,197
I’LL HELP YOU, BUT I’LL STILL
TRY AND FIND A WAY TO SAVE ’EM.

297
00:15:12,197 --> 00:15:15,197
Cardinal: HONESTLY,
YOUR OPTIMISM IS ABSURD.

298
00:15:15,197 --> 00:15:16,907
Kirito: MAYBE SO,

299
00:15:16,907 --> 00:15:19,327
BUT IF EVERYTHING GETS DELETED,
SO DO YOU.

300
00:15:19,327 --> 00:15:21,087
( Cardinal gasps )

301
00:15:21,087 --> 00:15:23,417
Kirito: IF I CAN’T
FIGURE THIS OUT, YOU CAN BET

302
00:15:23,417 --> 00:15:26,417
YOU’LL BE ONE OF THE TEN PEOPLE
I’M GONNA WANT SAVED.

303
00:15:26,417 --> 00:15:27,417
( Cardinal sighs )

304
00:15:27,417 --> 00:15:29,677
COULD YOU BE ANY MORE FOOLISH?

305
00:15:29,677 --> 00:15:32,137
HOW DO YOU EXPECT ME
TO EXTINGUISH THIS WORLD

306
00:15:32,137 --> 00:15:34,637
IF I AM NOT PRESENT
TO PERFORM THE TASK?

307
00:15:34,637 --> 00:15:37,227
Kirito: DON’T KNOW.
HEY, I’LL DO WHATEVER YOU SAY,

308
00:15:37,227 --> 00:15:38,767
BUT I’M GONNA TRY TO COME UP

309
00:15:38,767 --> 00:15:40,437
WITH A BETTER SOLUTION
ALL THE SAME.

310
00:15:40,437 --> 00:15:42,647
( Cardinal groans )

311
00:15:42,647 --> 00:15:48,237
SOMEDAY, YOU, TOO, WILL KNOW
THE BITTERNESS OF RESIGNATION.

312
00:15:48,237 --> 00:15:51,197
IT IS NOT THE SAME
AS TRYING AND FAILING.

313
00:15:51,197 --> 00:15:54,657
IT IS BEING FORCED
TO ADMIT FAILURE,

314
00:15:54,657 --> 00:15:57,447
REGARDLESS OF HOW HARD YOU TRY.

315
00:16:03,167 --> 00:16:04,917
( footsteps approaching )

316
00:16:04,917 --> 00:16:05,917
( Eugeo sighs )

317
00:16:05,917 --> 00:16:08,007
Kirito: THERE YOU ARE!

318
00:16:08,007 --> 00:16:09,717
WE THOUGHT
YOU WERE STILL IN THE BATH.

319
00:16:09,717 --> 00:16:13,097
Eugeo: I’M SORRY.
I GUESS I LOST TRACK OF TIME.

320
00:16:13,097 --> 00:16:16,307
Kirito: SO, UH,
CARDINAL AND I WERE TALKIN’.

321
00:16:16,307 --> 00:16:19,557
SHE USED TO BE THE--
THE PONTIFEX HERE

322
00:16:19,557 --> 00:16:22,307
’TIL ADMINISTRATOR KICKED
HER OUT AND TOOK OVER HER JOB.

323
00:16:22,307 --> 00:16:23,767
Eugeo: YOU WERE A PONTIFEX?

324
00:16:23,767 --> 00:16:25,647
Kirito: DON’T WORRY.
SHE’S ON OUR SIDE.

325
00:16:25,647 --> 00:16:28,147
SHE’S GONNA HELP US FIGHT
THE INTEGRITY KNIGHTS.

326
00:16:28,147 --> 00:16:30,237
- Eugeo: Y-YOU WILL?
- Kirito: YEAH.

327
00:16:30,237 --> 00:16:32,277
SHE WANTS TO GET HER TITLE
AS PONTIFEX BACK,

328
00:16:32,277 --> 00:16:34,317
BUT TO DO THAT,

329
00:16:34,317 --> 00:16:36,447
SHE’S GONNA HAVE TO TAKE DOWN
ADMINISTRATOR FIRST,

330
00:16:36,447 --> 00:16:39,657
SO, LIKE, SHE SORT OF
SUGGESTED WE JOIN FORCES.

331
00:16:39,657 --> 00:16:40,657
Cardinal: MM-HMM.

332
00:16:40,657 --> 00:16:42,747
Eugeo: THERE’S THIS GIRL,

333
00:16:42,747 --> 00:16:45,787
AN INTEGRITY KNIGHT
CALLED ALICE SYNTHESIS THIRTY.

334
00:16:45,787 --> 00:16:49,377
I THINK SHE’S THE SAME PERSON
AS AN ALICE ZUBERG FROM RULID.

335
00:16:49,377 --> 00:16:50,757
DO YOU KNOW IF SHE IS?

336
00:16:50,757 --> 00:16:53,297
Cardinal: I’M SORRY,
BUT THE INFORMATION

337
00:16:53,297 --> 00:16:56,177
I’M ABLE TO ACCESS HERE
IS EXTREMELY LIMITED.

338
00:16:56,177 --> 00:17:00,427
I KNOW INTEGRITY KNIGHT ALICE
WAS BORN, BUT NO OTHER DETAILS.

339
00:17:00,427 --> 00:17:04,647
HOWEVER, I CAN TELL YOU HOW
TO UNDO THE SYNTHESIS RITUAL,

340
00:17:04,647 --> 00:17:07,397
THE SACRED ART
THAT CREATES INTEGRITY KNIGHTS.

341
00:17:07,397 --> 00:17:10,067
( Eugeo gasps )
AND HOW DO I DO THAT?

342
00:17:10,067 --> 00:17:12,397
Cardinal: SIMPLY REMOVE
THE PIETY MODULE.

343
00:17:12,397 --> 00:17:14,697
ALL THE KNIGHTS HAVE ONE
IN THEIR FOREHEAD.

344
00:17:14,697 --> 00:17:16,617
IT LOOKS LIKE
A TRIANGULAR PRISM.

345
00:17:16,617 --> 00:17:19,407
( Eugeo gasps ) WE SAW ONE.

346
00:17:19,407 --> 00:17:22,617
Cardinal: ONCE THE PIETY MODULE
IS INSERTED,

347
00:17:22,617 --> 00:17:25,497
IT EFFECTIVELY BLOCKS
THE LINKS TO MEMORIES.

348
00:17:25,497 --> 00:17:29,127
WITH THAT, THE PROSPECTIVE
KNIGHT’S PAST IS SEALED AWAY--

349
00:17:29,127 --> 00:17:32,337
THE RESULT, A KNIGHT
WHO IS LOYAL TO THE CHURCH

350
00:17:32,337 --> 00:17:34,637
AND TO THEIR CREATOR,
THE PONTIFEX.

351
00:17:34,637 --> 00:17:36,887
Kirito: WE ALMOST BROKE
THE SPELL ON ONE OF ’EM.

352
00:17:36,887 --> 00:17:39,007
WE REMINDED HIM
OF WHO HE USED TO BE,

353
00:17:39,007 --> 00:17:40,387
AND THE CRYSTAL POPPED OUT.

354
00:17:40,387 --> 00:17:42,727
Cardinal: THAT IS NOT ENOUGH
TO FREE A KNIGHT.

355
00:17:42,727 --> 00:17:45,727
ANOTHER ELEMENT IS REQUIRED
IN ORDER TO BREAK THE SPELL.

356
00:17:45,727 --> 00:17:47,807
Eugeo: AND? WHAT WOULD THAT BE?

357
00:17:47,807 --> 00:17:49,897
Cardinal: THE THING
THAT ONCE EXISTED

358
00:17:49,897 --> 00:17:52,647
IN THE PLACE
WHERE THE MODULE WAS INSERTED,

359
00:17:52,647 --> 00:17:55,407
OR, MORE SPECIFICALLY,
A MEMORY FRAGMENT,

360
00:17:55,407 --> 00:17:57,947
ONE THE INTEGRITY KNIGHT
TREASURES THE MOST.

361
00:17:57,947 --> 00:18:00,617
ADMINISTRATOR IS
A CAUTIOUS WOMAN.

362
00:18:00,617 --> 00:18:02,577
I DON’T DOUBT SHE KEEPS

363
00:18:02,577 --> 00:18:04,827
ALL THE MEMORY FRAGMENTS
CLOSE AT HAND.

364
00:18:04,827 --> 00:18:07,167
IF ANYWHERE,
THEY’D BE IN HER CHAMBER,

365
00:18:07,167 --> 00:18:11,507
LOCATED ON THE TOP FLOOR
OF THE CENTRAL CATHEDRAL.

366
00:18:11,507 --> 00:18:13,627
Kirito: OKAY,
SO TO TURN THE KNIGHTS

367
00:18:13,627 --> 00:18:15,467
BACK TO THE WAY THEY WERE,

368
00:18:15,467 --> 00:18:18,217
WE NEED TO GET OUR HANDS
ON THEIR MEMORY FRAGMENTS.

369
00:18:18,217 --> 00:18:19,927
BUT I DOUBT
THE INTEGRITY KNIGHTS

370
00:18:19,927 --> 00:18:22,677
ARE JUST GONNA LET US
WALK UP TO ADMINISTRATOR’S ROOM.

371
00:18:22,677 --> 00:18:24,937
I BET WE’RE GONNA HAVE
TO FIGHT EVERY ONE OF ’EM

372
00:18:24,937 --> 00:18:26,767
ALL THE WAY
TO THE TOP OF THE CATHEDRAL.

373
00:18:26,767 --> 00:18:28,807
Cardinal: DON’T BE NAIVE.

374
00:18:28,807 --> 00:18:30,897
AN INTEGRITY KNIGHT
DOES NOT STOP

375
00:18:30,897 --> 00:18:33,357
UNTIL EITHER YOU
OR THEY ARE DEAD.

376
00:18:33,357 --> 00:18:36,737
I CAN HELP YOU GET EQUIPMENT
THAT IS EQUAL TO THEIRS,

377
00:18:36,737 --> 00:18:39,737
BUT THAT IS
ALL THE ASSISTANCE I CAN OFFER.

378
00:18:39,737 --> 00:18:41,947
THE REST WILL BE
UP TO YOUR SKILLS

379
00:18:41,947 --> 00:18:44,407
AND WHETHER YOU HAVE
THE STAMINA TO ENDURE.

380
00:18:44,407 --> 00:18:47,867
Eugeo: IF ALICE SHOWS UP
AND I HAVE TO FIGHT HER,

381
00:18:47,867 --> 00:18:49,377
I-I DON’T WANT TO HURT HER.

382
00:18:49,377 --> 00:18:51,167
I CAN’T.

383
00:18:51,167 --> 00:18:54,337
I JUST WANT TO TAKE HER
BACK TO OUR VILLAGE.

384
00:18:54,337 --> 00:18:56,167
Cardinal: I KNOW. I UNDERSTAND.

385
00:18:56,167 --> 00:18:58,427
YOUR INTENTION IS HONORABLE,

386
00:18:58,427 --> 00:19:02,757
AND I HAVE AN IDEA THAT SHOULD
SATISFY YOU, SO DON’T FRET.

387
00:19:02,757 --> 00:19:04,977
WHEN YOU COME ACROSS
ALICE THE KNIGHT,

388
00:19:04,977 --> 00:19:07,687
YOU’LL BE ARMED WITH SOMETHING
THAT WON’T KILL HER.

389
00:19:07,687 --> 00:19:08,597
I MADE THEM SPECIAL.

390
00:19:10,607 --> 00:19:11,567
Kirito: DAGGERS?

391
00:19:11,567 --> 00:19:13,277
Cardinal: OBVIOUSLY.

392
00:19:13,277 --> 00:19:16,027
WHOEVER THEY PIERCE
WILL BE INSTANTLY LINKED TO ME

393
00:19:16,027 --> 00:19:18,737
IN THIS LIBRARY
BY AN UNBREAKABLE CONNECTION.

394
00:19:18,737 --> 00:19:20,817
THE PERSON
WILL THEN BE SUSCEPTIBLE

395
00:19:20,817 --> 00:19:23,287
TO WHATEVER SACRED ART I CAST.

396
00:19:23,287 --> 00:19:27,287
TAKE THEM. ALL YOU HAVE TO DO
IS PIERCE HER FLESH

397
00:19:27,287 --> 00:19:29,287
WITH JUST ONE
OF THOSE DAGGERS.

398
00:19:29,287 --> 00:19:31,787
IN THAT INSTANT,
I WILL USE MY SACRED ARTS

399
00:19:31,787 --> 00:19:33,877
TO PUT HER INTO A DEEP SLEEP.

400
00:19:33,877 --> 00:19:37,257
SHE WILL STAY THAT WAY UNTIL YOU
HAVE HER MEMORY FRAGMENT

401
00:19:37,257 --> 00:19:39,377
AND ARE READY
TO REMOVE THE SYNTHESIS.

402
00:19:39,377 --> 00:19:40,887
Eugeo: ALL RIGHT, THEN.

403
00:19:40,887 --> 00:19:43,257
IF I CAN’T MANAGE
TO TALK SENSE INTO HER,

404
00:19:43,257 --> 00:19:44,967
I WILL USE YOUR DAGGERS.

405
00:19:44,967 --> 00:19:49,437
Cardinal: ACTUALLY, ONE OF THOSE
IS INTENDED FOR ADMINISTRATOR.

406
00:19:49,437 --> 00:19:51,937
THE OTHER ONE
IS SUPPOSED TO BE A SPARE.

407
00:19:51,937 --> 00:19:55,437
EITHER WAY, WHO GETS STABBED
WITH WHICH IS UP TO YOU NOW.

408
00:19:55,437 --> 00:19:57,437
Kirito: DAMN, TALK ABOUT
PUTTIN’ ON THE PRESSURE.

409
00:19:57,437 --> 00:19:59,947
- WAIT. WE STILL NEED GEAR.
- Cardinal: HMM?

410
00:19:59,947 --> 00:20:01,867
Kirito: YOU SAID
YOU’D HELP US GET STUFF

411
00:20:01,867 --> 00:20:03,527
THAT’S EQUAL
TO WHAT THE KNIGHTS HAVE.

412
00:20:03,527 --> 00:20:05,487
Cardinal: YOU AND EUGEO HAVE
POWERFUL SWORDS OF YOUR OWN,

413
00:20:05,487 --> 00:20:07,577
DO YOU NOT?

414
00:20:07,577 --> 00:20:09,747
THOSE SHOULD BE MORE THAN EQUAL
TO WHAT ANY KNIGHT HAS.

415
00:20:09,747 --> 00:20:12,327
Eugeo: DOES THAT MEAN
WHAT I THINK IT DOES?

416
00:20:12,327 --> 00:20:14,247
CAN YOU GET OUR SWORDS BACK?

417
00:20:14,247 --> 00:20:16,297
Cardinal: OF COURSE.
THERE IS AN ARMORY

418
00:20:16,297 --> 00:20:18,337
ON THE THIRD FLOOR
OF THE CATHEDRAL.

419
00:20:18,337 --> 00:20:21,587
THAT IS MOST LIKELY
WHERE THEY ARE BEING KEPT.

420
00:20:21,587 --> 00:20:24,047
Kirito: BY THE WAY,
HOW FAR UP DO WE HAVE TO GO

421
00:20:24,047 --> 00:20:26,007
TO GET TO ADMINISTRATOR’S ROOM?

422
00:20:26,007 --> 00:20:27,807
Cardinal: EACH YEAR,
THE CENTRAL CATHEDRAL

423
00:20:27,807 --> 00:20:30,097
GROWS TALLER THAN THE LAST,

424
00:20:30,097 --> 00:20:32,807
SO HER CHAMBER SHOULD BE
ON THE 100th FLOOR BY NOW.

425
00:20:32,807 --> 00:20:34,647
( Kirito groans )

426
00:20:34,647 --> 00:20:36,017
Cardinal: UNFORTUNATELY...

427
00:20:36,017 --> 00:20:38,237
THERE IS ONE MORE THING
YOU NEED TO DO.

428
00:20:38,237 --> 00:20:40,147
Kirito: AH. YOU DON’T SAY.

429
00:20:40,147 --> 00:20:41,607
Cardinal:
YOUR SWORDS ARE POWERFUL.

430
00:20:41,607 --> 00:20:43,617
THAT MUCH IS TRUE,

431
00:20:43,617 --> 00:20:46,657
BUT THEY’RE NOT ENOUGH TO BRING
DOWN THE INTEGRITY KNIGHTS.

432
00:20:46,657 --> 00:20:48,907
THEY KNOW A TECHNIQUE
WHICH ALLOWS THEM

433
00:20:48,907 --> 00:20:50,617
TO AMPLIFY
THEIR WEAPONS’S ABILITIES

434
00:20:50,617 --> 00:20:52,917
MANY TIMES
OVER WHAT IS NORMAL.

435
00:20:52,917 --> 00:20:56,627
Eugeo: RIGHT. I BELIEVE IT’S
CALLED PERFECT WEAPON CONTROL.

436
00:20:56,627 --> 00:20:58,627
Cardinal: ONCE THEY
ACTIVATE THE SPELL,

437
00:20:58,627 --> 00:21:00,627
DIVINE WEAPONS
TAKE ON THE PROPERTIES

438
00:21:00,627 --> 00:21:03,587
OF THE THING
THE WEAPON ONCE WAS.

439
00:21:03,587 --> 00:21:07,927
IN OTHER WORDS, PERFECT CONTROL
RELEASES THE WEAPON’S MEMORY.

440
00:21:07,927 --> 00:21:10,767
AS A RESULT,
IT CAN UNLEASH POTENT ATTACKS

441
00:21:10,767 --> 00:21:12,557
THAT ARE FAR BEYOND NORMAL.

442
00:21:12,557 --> 00:21:15,017
I WILL ARM YOU BOTH
WITH THAT POWER.

443
00:21:15,017 --> 00:21:17,317
CLOSE YOUR EYES,
AND THINK OF YOUR SWORD.

444
00:21:17,317 --> 00:21:19,607
♪

445
00:21:24,447 --> 00:21:26,277
( wood creaking )

446
00:21:41,667 --> 00:21:43,587
( crystal clinking )

447
00:21:50,677 --> 00:21:52,177
ALL RIGHT. IT IS DONE.

448
00:21:53,807 --> 00:21:55,397
( staff rings clinking )

449
00:21:57,607 --> 00:21:58,767
( both grunt )

450
00:21:58,767 --> 00:21:59,687
Cardinal: HERE.

451
00:22:01,357 --> 00:22:03,527
Kirito: UH...

452
00:22:03,527 --> 00:22:05,567
Cardinal: COMMIT
ALL THE WORDS TO MEMORY.

453
00:22:05,567 --> 00:22:07,777
♪

454
00:22:07,777 --> 00:22:08,737
( rings jingle )

455
00:22:13,867 --> 00:22:16,117
NOW THEN, EUGEO AND KIRITO,

456
00:22:16,117 --> 00:22:19,997
THE FATE OF THIS WORLD
IS UP TO YOU,

457
00:22:19,997 --> 00:22:22,337
WHETHER IT IS
ENGULFED IN HELLFIRE

458
00:22:22,337 --> 00:22:24,047
OR VANISHES ENTIRELY.

459
00:22:25,967 --> 00:22:29,097
OR, WITH ANY LUCK, PERHAPS
YOU’LL FIND A THIRD PATH.

460
00:22:29,097 --> 00:22:32,307
REGARDLESS, I HAVE TOLD YOU
ALL THAT I CAN TELL

461
00:22:32,307 --> 00:22:35,847
AND GIVEN YOU
ALL THAT I CAN GIVE.

462
00:22:35,847 --> 00:22:39,227
ALL THAT IS LEFT
IS TO TRUST IN YOURSELVES.

463
00:22:39,227 --> 00:22:41,777
Eugeo: THANK YOU
FOR ALL YOUR HELP, CARDINAL.

464
00:22:41,777 --> 00:22:44,897
I KNOW I’LL MAKE IT
TO THE TOP OF THE CATHEDRAL

465
00:22:44,897 --> 00:22:46,737
AND RESTORE ALICE’S MEMORY.

466
00:22:46,737 --> 00:22:47,857
( Kirito sighs )

467
00:22:49,817 --> 00:22:51,657
( singing in Japanese )

468
00:22:52,787 --> 00:22:54,447
Cardinal: EH...

469
00:22:54,447 --> 00:22:55,407
( chuckles )

470
00:22:55,407 --> 00:22:56,157
NOW THEN...

471
00:22:57,667 --> 00:22:58,827
OFF WITH YOU!

472
00:23:06,757 --> 00:23:07,587
( Kirito grunts )

473
00:23:15,637 --> 00:23:16,727
( Cardinal chuckles )

474
00:23:26,947 --> 00:23:29,947
Singer: ♪ THE IRIS TO YOU ♪

